parts.questionTextEn:
The table below shows the distribution of the numbers of children of some families. (The numbers of families with $0,1,2,3$ children are $3,k,10,8$ respectively, where $k$ is a positive integer.) If the mode of the distribution is $2$ , write down
(i) the least possible value of $k$ ;
(ii) the greatest possible value of $k$ .

If the median of the distribution is $2$ , write down
(i) the least possible value of $k$ ;
(ii) the greatest possible value of $k$ .
